{"id":"97f9e7d6cde71381","group":"58","path":"58/batch14/58-df-cyclotomic-field.md","title":"Cyclotomic Field","display":"df-cyclotomic-field — Cyclotomic Field","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-cyclotomic-field","aliases":["58-df-cyclotomic-field","Cyclotomic Field"],"display":"df-cyclotomic-field — Cyclotomic Field","depends_on":["[[../batch12/58-df-root-of-unity.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-field.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-cyclotomic-field"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-cyclotomic-field</span><span>Cyclotomic Field</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-cyclotomic-field — Cyclotomic Field"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"853d73c57bd2049d\" href=\"?note=853d73c57bd2049d\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-root-of-unity.md\">../batch12/58-df-root-of-unity.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1eb4a89b005d9cda\" href=\"?note=1eb4a89b005d9cda\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-field.md\">../batch13/58-df-field.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\\in V\">\\(K\\in V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RootOfUnityStructure}_S\\subseteq V^7\">\\(\\mathrm{RootOfUnityStructure}_S\\subseteq V^7\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"853d73c57bd2049d\" href=\"?note=853d73c57bd2049d\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-root-of-unity.md\">../batch12/58-df-root-of-unity.md</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Field}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Field}_S\\)</span> is the explicit field predicate from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1eb4a89b005d9cda\" href=\"?note=1eb4a89b005d9cda\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-field.md\">../batch13/58-df-field.md</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CyclotomicField}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{CyclotomicField}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cyclotomic-field} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{CyclotomicField}_S(K,n) \\leftrightarrow\nn\\in\\mathbb{N}\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land\n\\exists\\zeta\\in\\mathbb C\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{RootOfUnityStructure}_S(\\zeta,n,\\mathbb C,+_{\\mathbb C},\\cdot_{\\mathbb C},0_{\\mathbb C},1_{\\mathbb C})\\land\n\\forall d\\in\\mathbb N\\;(0&lt;d&lt;n\\to\\zeta^d\\neq1)\\land\nK=\\bigcap\\Bigl\\{F\\subseteq\\mathbb C:\n\\mathbb Q\\cup\\{\\zeta\\}\\subseteq F\\land\n\\mathrm{Field}_S\\bigl(F,+_{\\mathbb C}\\upharpoonright F^2,\n\\cdot_{\\mathbb C}\\upharpoonright F^2,0_{\\mathbb C},1_{\\mathbb C}\\bigr)\\Bigr\\}\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cyclotomic-field} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{CyclotomicField}_S(K,n) \\leftrightarrow\nn\\in\\mathbb{N}\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land\n\\exists\\zeta\\in\\mathbb C\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{RootOfUnityStructure}_S(\\zeta,n,\\mathbb C,+_{\\mathbb C},\\cdot_{\\mathbb C},0_{\\mathbb C},1_{\\mathbb C})\\land\n\\forall d\\in\\mathbb N\\;(0&lt;d&lt;n\\to\\zeta^d\\neq1)\\land\nK=\\bigcap\\Bigl\\{F\\subseteq\\mathbb C:\n\\mathbb Q\\cup\\{\\zeta\\}\\subseteq F\\land\n\\mathrm{Field}_S\\bigl(F,+_{\\mathbb C}\\upharpoonright F^2,\n\\cdot_{\\mathbb C}\\upharpoonright F^2,0_{\\mathbb C},1_{\\mathbb C}\\bigr)\\Bigr\\}\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Cyclotomic: splitting field of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x^n - 1\">\\(x^n - 1\\)</span>; roots of unity fields</li>\n<li>The minimality clause makes <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\zeta\">\\(\\zeta\\)</span> a primitive <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>-th root; only then does <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[\\mathbb Q(\\zeta):\\mathbb Q]=\\varphi(n)\">\\([\\mathbb Q(\\zeta):\\mathbb Q]=\\varphi(n)\\)</span> hold uniformly.</li>\n<li>The generated field is expanded as the intersection of all complex subfields containing <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb Q\\cup\\{\\zeta\\}\">\\(\\mathbb Q\\cup\\{\\zeta\\}\\)</span>; neither a hidden algebraic closure nor an undefined field-generation operator remains.</li>\n<li>Discriminant: computed by Dedekind; divides <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\phi(n)^n\">\\(\\phi(n)^n\\)</span></li>\n<li>Kronecker-Weber: abelian extensions of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb{Q}\">\\(\\mathbb{Q}\\)</span> are subfields of cyclotomic fields</li>\n<li>Iwasawa: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb{Z}_p\">\\(\\mathbb{Z}_p\\)</span>-extensions of cyclotomic fields; main conjecture in Iwasawa theory</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Washington, Introduction to Cyclotomic Fields</li>\n<li>Lang, Cyclotomic Fields I and II</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch12/58-df-root-of-unity.md","status":"resolved","id":"853d73c57bd2049d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-root-of-unity.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-field.md","status":"resolved","id":"1eb4a89b005d9cda","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-field.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-root-of-unity.md","status":"resolved","id":"853d73c57bd2049d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{RootOfUnityStructure}_S\\subseteq V^7$ (see [[../batch12/58-df-root-of-unity.md]]).","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-field.md","status":"resolved","id":"1eb4a89b005d9cda","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Field}_S$ is the explicit field predicate from [[../batch13/58-df-field.md]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"K\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RootOfUnityStructure}_S\\subseteq V^7","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Field}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CyclotomicField}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cyclotomic-field} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{CyclotomicField}_S(K,n) \\leftrightarrow\nn\\in\\mathbb{N}\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land\n\\exists\\zeta\\in\\mathbb C\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{RootOfUnityStructure}_S(\\zeta,n,\\mathbb C,+_{\\mathbb C},\\cdot_{\\mathbb C},0_{\\mathbb C},1_{\\mathbb C})\\land\n\\forall d\\in\\mathbb N\\;(0<d<n\\to\\zeta^d\\neq1)\\land\nK=\\bigcap\\Bigl\\{F\\subseteq\\mathbb C:\n\\mathbb Q\\cup\\{\\zeta\\}\\subseteq F\\land\n\\mathrm{Field}_S\\bigl(F,+_{\\mathbb C}\\upharpoonright F^2,\n\\cdot_{\\mathbb C}\\upharpoonright F^2,0_{\\mathbb C},1_{\\mathbb C}\\bigr)\\Bigr\\}\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"x^n - 1","display":false},{"tex":"\\zeta","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"[\\mathbb Q(\\zeta):\\mathbb Q]=\\varphi(n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb Q\\cup\\{\\zeta\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\phi(n)^n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb{Q}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb{Z}_p","display":false}],"bytes":1937,"backlinks":[{"id":"9197104486eef137","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CyclotomicField}_S$ (cyclotomic-field predicate, see [[58-df-cyclotomic-field]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-394","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-cyclotomic-field.md|58-df-cyclotomic-field]]（batch14）"}],"outgoing":["853d73c57bd2049d","1eb4a89b005d9cda"]}